5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We should be careful not to repeat past failures. I want to see the actual outcomes of previous trials.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Logistics are often overlooked. I will look into the physical and digital capacity of the facility.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I agree with Asuka. I am interested in why previous collaborations failed and how external agreements hold up.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm worried about the people doing the work! I want to see how the staffing is actually looking.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is wise to be thorough. I shall examine the financial ledger and the regional funding structures.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, do you think the booking system is a primary bottleneck?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,It is a possibility. I will check both the system and the physical space.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, staffing is key, but so is the legal framework for outside partnerships.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"That makes sense, Benjamin! I'll stick to the nursing and therapy reviews.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,Let us ensure we are not just building a house we cannot afford to heat.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
