35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Previous call-backs reduced readmissions, but home visits are often missed due to access issues.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The facility is at capacity. Parking and rooms are full, and the booking system ignores non-appointment work.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Joint clinics have failed here due to budget disputes, and external data agreements take over a year.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"Ward nursing is struggling with vacancies, but the midwifery rota actually has some slack.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Our budget is smaller this year, and notably, off-site contacts bring in no regional funding.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, if off-site work earns nothing, then home-based programs are a financial risk.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, if data agreements take fourteen months, any program relying on outside surgeries is doomed.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. We need something internal or something that doesn't require complex legal ties.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, if the midwifery team has slack, maybe we can use them for a new program?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"A very positive suggestion, Yumi. We must align our ambitions with our actual resources.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,We need a program that is sustainable and doesn't vanish from the records.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,It must be on-site to be billable and manageable within our current space.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"And it must avoid the ""joint-run"" trap where no one takes responsibility for the rota.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Yumi,,I just don't want to burn out the ward nurses. They are already using too many agencies.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,Logic and compassion must meet. We need a program that earns its keep and supports the staff.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
